<p>Information may be stored when required for the bot's features. The bot owner should document actual storage practices and retention periods before deploying the bot.</p>

<h2>4. Sharing</h2>
<p>Information should not be shared with third parties except where necessary to operate the service or comply with applicable law.</p>

<h2>5. Data Requests</h2>
<p>Users may contact the bot owner through the designated support channel to ask about their information or request deletion where applicable.</p>

<h2>6. Contact</h2>
<p>Contact the bot owner through the bot's designated support channel for privacy questions.</p>
